io/kononenko/afYFYcBOoF08xjTN_intro.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;w=2400&amp;fm=jpeg&amp;q=95 2400w, https://images.prismic.io/kononenko/afYFYcBOoF08xjTN_intro.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;w=2800&amp;fm=jpeg&amp;q=95 2800w, https://images.prismic.io/kononenko/afYFYcBOoF08xjTN_intro.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;w=3600&amp;fm=jpeg&amp;q=95 3600w, https://images.prismic.io/kononenko/afYFYcBOoF08xjTN_intro.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;w=4000&amp;fm=jpeg&amp;q=95 4000w\"><!--]--><!--]--></picture></div></div></div></section><section class=\"aie rfi\"><div class=\"ctr\"><div class=\"xnm\"><div class=\"zgh\"><div class=\"hbt\"><!--[--><div class=\"ine\"><h3 class=\"fn-b1 kyd f-sf\"><!--[-->Founded<!--]--></h3><p class=\"jgn\"><!--[-->2011<!--]--></p></div><div class=\"ine\"><h3 class=\"fn-b1 kyd f-sf\"><!--[-->Founder<!--]--></h3><p class=\"jgn\"><!--[-->Anton Kononenko<!--]--></p></div><div class=\"ine\"><h3 class=\"fn-b1 kyd f-sf\"><!--[-->Services<!--]--></h3><p class=\"jgn\"><!--[-->From architectural vision to final drawings — including facades, layouts, sketches, documentation, and immersive visualizations.<!--]--></p></div><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"nob\"><p class=\"fn-h5\"><!--[-->An architecture bureau rooted in precision and emotion. We design with a deep understanding of context, function, and timeless form — shaping environments that feel effortless, intuitive, and distinctly refined. From urban masterplans to boutique interiors, each project is tailored with vision and care.<!--]--></p></div></div><div class=\"zlz grd\"><h3 class=\"fn-b1 oyt f-sf\"><!--[--> Achievement <!--]--></h3><h3 class=\"fn-b1 xba f-sf\"><!--[--> Awards <!--]--></h3><div class=\"eay\"><div class=\"hbt\"><p><!--[-->Kukha Design Award 2025<!--]--></p><p class=\"xgs\"><!--[-->1st place in the category<!--]--></p><p class=\"xgs\"><!--[-->&quot;Public Building Architecture&quot;<!--]--></p><p class=\"xgs\"><!--[--> &quot;Completed Apartment Interior over 60 sq.m&quot;<!--]--></p></div><d