:13,\"alternate_languages\":116,\"data\":117},\"abbryxEAACIAarSo\",\"home\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fkononenko.cdn.prismic.io\\u002Fapi\\u002Fv2\\u002Fdocuments\\u002Fsearch?ref=ajPHvBEAAC0AXum-&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22abbryxEAACIAarSo%22%29+%5D%5D\",[],\"2026-03-15T17:27:04+0000\",\"2026-06-17T08:30:47+0000\",[109],[],[],{\"title\":26,\"image\":118,\"intro_title\":121,\"intro_title_second\":122,\"intro_desc_left\":123,\"intro_desc_right\":124,\"intro_image\":125,\"bio_founded\":131,\"bio_founder\":132,\"bio_services\":133,\"bio_team\":134,\"bio_desc\":135,\"office_title\":136,\"vision_text_one\":137,\"vision_text_two\":138,\"partner_title\":139,\"partner_list\":140,\"sketch_title\":245,\"sketch_image\":246,\"sketch_subtitle\":253,\"sketch_label\":245,\"sketch_description\":254,\"sketch_strategy_label\":255,\"sketch_development_title\":256,\"sketch_development_image\":257,\"sketch_development_description\":264,\"slices\":265,\"meta_description\":135,\"meta_image\":266,\"meta_title\":26},{\"dimensions\":119,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":20,\"id\":21,\"edit\":120},{\"width\":18,\"height\":19},{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"Systematic\",\"Clarity & Creativity\",\"Sustainability strategy, material efficiency, passive systems, energy modeling, lifecycle analysis\",\"Сoncept, facade and planning solutions, sketch project, working documentation, visualizations\",{\"dimensions\":126,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":128,\"id\":129,\"edit\":130},{\"width\":18,\"height\":127},752,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FafYFYcBOoF08xjTN_intro.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"afYFYcBOoF08xjTN\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"2011\",\"Anton Kononenko\",\"From architectural vision to final drawings — including facades, layouts, sketches, documentation, and immersive visualizations.\",\"Team of 45+ specialists\",\"An architecture bureau rooted in precision and emotion.\\u2028We design with a deep understanding of context, function, and timeless form — shaping environments that feel effortless, intuitive, and distinctly refined. From urban masterplans to boutique interiors, each project is tailored with vision and care.\",\"Architectural concept, facade and planning solutions, sketch project, working documentation, visualizations.\",\"Refined & Bold Essential\",\"Simplicity & Clarity of Approach\",\"World’s Most Ambitious Brands\\u2028Choose to Work With Us\",[141,149,155,161,167,173,179,185,191,197,203,209,215,221,227,233,239],{\"image\":142},{\"dimensions\":143,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":146,\"id\":147,\"edit\":148},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},116,115,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcXbK9tuLqEHTA_parnter-1.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcXbK9tuLqEHTA\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":150},{\"dimensions\":151,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":152,\"id\":153,\"edit\":154},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcXrK9tuLqEHTB_parnter-2.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcXrK9tuLqEHTB\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":156},{\"dimensions\":157,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":158,\"id\":159,\"edit\":160},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcX7K9tuLqEHTC_parnter-3.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcX7K9tuLqEHTC\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":162},{\"dimensions\":163,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":164,\"id\":165,\"edit\":166},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcYLK9tuLqEHTD_parnter-4.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcYLK9tuLqEHTD\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":168},{\"dimensions\":169,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":170,\"id\":171,\"edit\":172},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcYbK9tuLqEHTE_parnter-5.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcYbK9tuLqEHTE\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":174},{\"dimensions\":175,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":176,\"id\":177,\"edit\":178},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcYrK9tuLqEHTF_parnter-6.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcYrK9tuLqEHTF\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":180},{\"dimensions\":181,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":182,\"id\":183,\"edit\":184},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcY7K9tuLqEHTG_parnter-7.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcY7K9tuLqEHTG\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":186},{\"dimensions\":187,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":188,\"id\":189,\"edit\":190},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcZLK9tuLqEHTI_parnter-8.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcZLK9tuLqEHTI\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":192},{\"dimensions\":193,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":194,\"id\":195,\"edit\":196},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcZbK9tuLqEHTJ_parnter-9.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcZbK9tuLqEHTJ\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":198},{\"dimensions\":199,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":200,\"id\":201,\"edit\":202},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcZrK9tuLqEHTK_parnter-10.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcZrK9tuLqEHTK\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":204},{\"dimensions\":205,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":206,\"id\":207,\"edit\":208},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcZ7K9tuLqEHTL_parnter-11.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcZ7K9tuLqEHTL\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":210},{\"dimensions\":211,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":212,\"id\":213,\"edit\":214},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcaLK9tuLqEHTM_parnter-12.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcaLK9tuLqEHTM\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":216},{\"dimensions\":217,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":218,\"id\":219,\"edit\":220},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcabK9tuLqEHTN_parnter-13.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcabK9tuLqEHTN\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":222},{\"dimensions\":223,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":224,\"id\":225,\"edit\":226},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcarK9tuLqEHTO_parnter-14.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcarK9tuLqEHTO\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":228},{\"dimensions\":229,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":230,\"id\":231,\"edit\":232},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQca7K9tuLqEHTP_parnter-15.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQca7K9tuLqEHTP\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":234},{\"dimensions\":235,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":236,\"id\":237,\"edit\":238},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcbLK9tuLqEHTQ_parnter-16.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcbLK9tuLqEHTQ\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":240},{\"dimensions\":241,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":242,\"id\":243,\"edit\":244},{\"width\":144,\"height\":145},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FahQcbbK9tuLqEHTS_parnter-17.png?auto=format,compress\",\"ahQcbbK9tuLqEHTS\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"From Sketch to Strategy\",{\"dimensions\":247,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":250,\"id\":251,\"edit\":252},{\"width\":248,\"height\":249},1829,1102,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002Fagb9qqYofJOwHRTH_sketch-1.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"agb9qqYofJOwHRTH\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"Early-stage ideas are distilled into precise frameworks, balancing intuition, analysis, and clarity.\",\"We begin with the essentials — sketches, diagrams, raw outlines. This is where we test the logic of space, the rhythm of circulation, and the relationship between human behavior and built form. Every line on paper is a question and an answer, a tool for clarity. Through dialogue between architects and developers, between vision and feasibility, we evolve each idea into a grounded, strategic direction — thoughtful, adaptable, and ready to be built.\",\"Publications\",\"Precision in Development\",{\"dimensions\":258,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":261,\"id\":262,\"edit\":263},{\"width\":259,\"height\":260},1889,1107,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002FagcBw6YofJOwHRVX_sketch-2.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"agcBw6YofJOwHRVX\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"At this stage, the idea takes on architectural clarity. We work out the layout, volume, and facades, create structural logic, and prepare the project for implementation. Through drawings, models, and approvals, the project gains precision—transforming from a concept into a coherent architectural system.\",[],{},{\"id\":268,\"uid\":5,\"url\":5,\"type\":269,\"href\":270,\"tags\":271,\"first_publication_date\":272,\"last_publication_date\":273,\"slugs\":274,\"linked_documents\":275,\"lang\":13,\"alternate_languages\":276,\"data\":277},\"ac47ChEAACQA2dBv\",\"about\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fkononenko.cdn.prismic.io\\u002Fapi\\u002Fv2\\u002Fdocuments\\u002Fsearch?ref=ajPHvBEAAC0AXum-&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ac47ChEAACQA2dBv%22%29+%5D%5D\",[],\"2026-04-02T10:00:14+0000\",\"2026-06-15T12:54:05+0000\",[269],[],[],{\"title\":278,\"image_hero\":279,\"office_label\":285,\"office_title\":135,\"office_list\":286,\"awards\":301,\"practice_label\":325,\"practice_desc\":326,\"team_title\":331,\"team_desc_left\":332,\"team_desc_right\":333,\"slices\":334,\"people_label\":335,\"people_description\":336,\"people_year\":337,\"people_year_second\":338,\"people_year_description_left\":339,\"people_year_description_right\":340,\"company_record\":341,\"people_images\":354,\"team_list\":458},\"Architects, designers, engineers — a team built on ideas and precision\",{\"dimensions\":280,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":282,\"id\":283,\"edit\":284},{\"width\":18,\"height\":281},1330,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002Fac47KZGXnQHGZMkX_about.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"ac47KZGXnQHGZMkX\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},\"Our Philosophy\",[287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300],{\"label\":55,\"location\":56,\"address\":57},{\"label\":59,\"location\":60,\"address\":61},{\"label\":63,\"location\":64,\"address\":65},{\"label\":67,\"location\":68,\"address\":69},{\"label\":71,\"location\":72,\"address\":73},{\"label\":75,\"location\":76,\"address\":77},{\"label\":79,\"location\":80,\"address\":81},{\"label\":83,\"location\":84,\"address\":85},{\"label\":87,\"location\":88,\"address\":89},{\"label\":79,\"location\":91,\"address\":92},{\"label\":67,\"location\":94,\"address\":95},{\"label\":59,\"location\":97,\"address\":98},{\"label\":100,\"location\":101,\"address\":102},{\"label\":79,\"location\":104,\"address\":105},[302,305,308,310,313,316,319,322],{\"title\":303,\"description\":304},\"Kukha Design Award 2025\",\"1st place in the nomination \\\"Realized interior of an apartment from 60 sq.m.\\\"\",{\"title\":306,\"description\":307},\"Beautiful Homes Press Fireplace Design 2024\",\"1st place in the nomination \\\"Modern fireplace\\\" — Pevchee\",{\"title\":303,\"description\":309},\"1st place in the category \\\"Public Building Architecture\\\" — Riverside\",{\"title\":311,\"description\":312},\"Best Interior Festival 2023\",\"Nominee of the competition \\\"Implemented public interior. Commercial interior\\\"\",{\"title\":314,\"description\":315},\"MosBuild Architecture & Design Award (MADA) 2025\",\"Finalist in the nomination \\\"Public interiors: HoReCa\\\" — Restaurant \\\"Krasa\\\"\",{\"title\":317,\"description\":318},\"Addawards 2023\",\"1st place in the competition \\\"Space\\\", \\\"Garden Ring\\\"\",{\"title\":320,\"description\":321},\"Interia Public Space Award 2024\",\"Top 100 best public spaces in Russia 2024 — Restaurant \\\"Krasa\\\" in Nizhny Novgorod\",{\"title\":323,\"description\":324},\"Best Office Awards 2023 Office Next\",\"1st place in the nomination \\\"Developers' Sales Office\\\"\",\"Our Best Practice Approach\",[327,329],{\"text\":328},\"Since, our architectural bureau has been dedicated to shaping environments that inspire, function, and endure. With a deep commitment to quality, innovation, and context, we create architectural solutions that balance aesthetics and utility, vision and reality. Over the years, we have worked on a wide spectrum of projects — from residential and commercial spaces to large-scale master plans — always approaching each task with a tailored perspective and a sensitivity to the needs of our clients and the character of the location.\",{\"text\":330},\"Clients seek us out not only for our architectural concepts, but also for our expertise in interior design, our ability to offer unconventional and effective planning solutions, and our experience in crafting integrated, strategic master plans. We believe that architecture should be more than just structures — it should tell a story, serve a purpose, and respond to the rhythms of human life. Whether we’re designing a private home, a workplace, a public space, or an entire district, our goal remains the same: to create thoughtful, transformative environments that elevate the everyday.\",\"Favorite Team\",\"Our sustainable design principles combine material efficiency and life analysis with innovative concepts.\",\"We connect architectural ideas and final forms through clear visualization and coordination.\",[],\"People & Process\",\"A studio shaped by clarity, trust, and a collective pursuit of thoughtful design.\",\"2011 Year\",\"of Foundation\",\"Design approach grounded in passive strategies, material logic, and environmental responsibility.\",\"Lifecycle-focused architecture with efficient systems, sustainable choices, and long-term value.\",[342,345,348,351],{\"number\":343,\"title\":344},\"15+\",\"Years of experience\",{\"number\":346,\"title\":347},\"490+\",\"Completed projects\",{\"number\":349,\"title\":350},\"45+\",\"Professionals on the team\",{\"number\":352,\"title\":353},\"40K\",\"Total area covered\",[355,362,368,374,380,386,392,398,404,410,416,422,428,434,440,446,452],{\"image\":356},{\"dimensions\":357,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":359,\"id\":360,\"edit\":361},{\"width\":358,\"height\":358},388,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002Fac49aZGXnQHGZMl6_people-1.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"ac49aZGXnQHGZMl6\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":363},{\"dimensions\":364,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":365,\"id\":366,\"edit\":367},{\"width\":358,\"height\":358},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002Fac49apGXnQHGZMl7_people-2.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"ac49apGXnQHGZMl7\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":369},{\"dimensions\":370,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":371,\"id\":372,\"edit\":373},{\"width\":358,\"height\":358},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fkononenko\\u002Fac49a5GXnQHGZMl8_people-3.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"ac49a5GXnQHGZMl8\",{\"x\":23,\"y\":23,\"zoom\":24,\"background\":25},{\"image\":375},{\"dimensions\":376,\"alt\":5,\"copyright\":5,\"url\":377,\"id\":378,\"edit\":379},{\"width\":358,\"